  "limits": [
    "The model assumes surviving uncorrupted storage and atomic transitions.",
    "The fixture stops recorded benchmark clients. The Docker writer survives until fixture cleanup.",
    "A fixture deadline alone does not establish behavioral RED. The record requires an actual work-invocation marker.",
    "Snapshots identify source bytes, not execution coverage for every file.",
    "Storage faults, other crash windows, full ownership, shutdown, durability, aggregate deadlines, and reserve bounds remain open.",
    "Hosted checks, enforcement, maintainer review, ratification, D2, and acceptance remain pending."
  ]
}
